---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Datafore is an analytics company based in Burnaby, BC, now focused on building a platform purpose-made for allied health clinics."
>
  <section class="border-b border-ink-100 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900 md:text-5xl">About Datafore</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
        Datafore started as a data and analytics consultancy, helping organizations get more value from the data
        they already had. That work — across data operations, governance, and cloud platforms — is what convinced
        us allied health needed an analytics product of its own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Why allied health</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Allied health clinics — physiotherapy, chiropractic, massage therapy, occupational therapy, and the
          disciplines around them — run on scheduling and billing tools that were never designed to answer
          performance questions. That's a gap we've seen consistently, and it's one Datafore is built to close,
          starting close to home in British Columbia.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Where we're based</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Datafore Analytics Inc. is based in Burnaby, BC. We're building the platform in close collaboration with
          founding clinics across the province before expanding further.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-ink-100 bg-ink-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-600">Team</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <img
          src="/images/sandeep-mehra.jpg"
          alt="Sandeep Mehra"
          class="h-28 w-28 rounded-full object-cover"
        />
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Sandeep Mehra</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-600">Product Manager, Analytics</p>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/smehra2/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-ink-600 underline decoration-ink-300 underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand-600"
          >
            Connect on LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-ink-600">
        We're a small team today, and growing. If you want to help build analytics for allied health in BC, we'd
        like to hear from you.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-700"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
